! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!  AFTER RUNNING (order matters -- see PRE-REGISTERED READING in header):
!   0. Convergence gate per BC (<0.3%).
!   1. Calibration gate: 15.128->SYMM, 24.190->ANTI, 37.818->ANTI,
!      53.828->SYMM (or ALL FOUR consistently inverted = swapped labels).
!      Any mixed result: STOP.
!   2. Decisive: which pass holds Omega_lit ~= 111.46? Compare its parity
!      against the solver block hosting raw=2.828013 (job 2317114 output).
!   3. Archive the full parity table (external hardening, Sec 10.7 item 8).
! ===========================================================================
